       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "▣ = append-only: rows are only ever added, never edited or deleted — the permanent, auditable history (ADR-0002/0028)."
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Arrows run parent → child: one row at the tail relates to many at the head, unless labelled."
